sequenceDiagram
    participant P as pipeline._run
    participant S as segmenter
    participant V as view_detector
    participant F as frame_reader
    participant R as impact_refiner
    participant M as metrics

    P->>S: segment_swing(frames, fps, sig)
    S-->>P: events(8)  # impact 为腕部粗定位
    P->>V: resolve(view, frames, meta, addr_index)
    V-->>P: (view, warning)
    P->>R: plan_refine_frames(events, signals, meta)
    R-->>P: (候选帧, 解码帧集合)
    P->>F: grab_frames(video, 事件帧 ∪ 校正窗口帧)
    F-->>P: frames_bgr
    P->>R: refine_impact(..., frames_bgr)
    R->>R: _ground_roi / _motion_signal / _detect_ball / _pick_candidates / _score
    R-->>P: ImpactRefineResult(available, new_array_index, delta_frames)

    alt refine.available 且 MIN ≤ |delta| ≤ MAX
        P->>S: reanchor_impact(frames, signals, events, new_index)
        S-->>P: rebuilt_events 或 None
        alt rebuilt 非 None
            P->>P: events = rebuilt; 若 |delta|≥阈值追加 WARN_IMPACT_REFINED
        end
    end
    P->>P: frames_bgr 过滤为仅 8 事件帧（释放窗口帧）
    P->>M: build_context + compute_phase_metrics(ctx)
    M-->>P: phase_metrics（基于校正后 impact 帧）
